# Decision Outcome

The AI Workforce Capacity Planning Platform formally adopts the Enterprise Forecast Dataset Framework as its permanent forecasting dataset architecture.

Every forecasting workflow must consume standardized datasets generated through this framework before model training, evaluation, inference, or model registration.

This decision completes the Enterprise Data Engineering Foundation and establishes the standardized interface supporting the Enterprise AI Engineering Foundation.

